{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2021-01-05 08:05:00', 'title': 'MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL ACQUIRES HU,\xa0A WELL-BEING SNACKING COMPANY', 'text': 'CHICAGO, JAN. 05, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL (NASDAQ: MDLZ) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ACQUIRED HU (AS IN “HUMAN”) MASTER HOLDINGS, THE PARENT COMPANY OF HU PRODUCTS, A FAST-GROWING US-BASED SNACKING COMPANY OFFERING HIGH-QUALITY SNACKS MADE FROM SIMPLE INGREDIENTS.'}